  "description": "A fully managed C# implementation of Leptonica 1.87.0, the image processing and image analysis library by Dan Bloomberg. No P/Invoke and no native binaries: the results match the C library, and the PNG, JPEG, TIFF, GIF, WebP, JPEG 2000, BMP and PNM codecs are included. SIMD, multithreading and optional GPU acceleration.",
